---
name: ascii-schemas
allowed-tools:
  - MCP(wiretext:*)
description: >-
  Generate ASCII schemas, diagrams, and UI wireframes using Unicode box-drawing
  characters (wiretext conventions). Use when creating architecture diagrams,
